- **Service:** FastAPI
- **Dashboard:** Streamlit
- **Packaging and automation:** Docker, automated CI

## Getting started

> Setup and usage instructions will be added as the pipeline, service and dashboard are built (Application Development phase, 4 Jan – 24 Jan 2027).

## Known risks and limitations

- **Data availability.** A suitable public CI dataset with reliable timestamps and labels must be available. The planned audit and go/no-go gate address this.
- **Predictions are not code-quality judgments.** Failures can come from flaky tests, infrastructure or configuration problems as well as code regressions.
- **Historical inspection only.** The dashboard inspects past builds. There is no live GitHub integration.

The full list of limitations will be stated in the model card.

